<title>USA: NewGold cites Relief Canyon gold data.</title>
<headline>NewGold cites Relief Canyon gold data.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>NewGold Inc on Friday said data compilation performed in April by NewGold staff of 474 onsite vertical and angle reverse-circulation drill holes at Relief Canyon reflected higher levels of gold.</p>
<p>The results showed an increase to 696,353 gold ounces at a 0.010 gold ounce/ton cutoff in April from 310,000 gold ounces at a 0.010 gold ounce/ton cutoff in the same month of 1996.</p>
</text>
